01:10:06.539 --> 01:10:07.372
- Yes please, yes.
- Just a sec.

01:10:07.372 --> 01:10:10.700
There's a difference between
the quantum phenomena

01:10:10.700 --> 01:10:13.810
and the current somewhat
confused understanding

01:10:13.810 --> 01:10:15.470
of the quantum phenomena.

01:10:15.470 --> 01:10:17.790
The anomalies in that understanding

01:10:17.790 --> 01:10:21.390
are not essentially anomalies
in quantum phenomena.

01:10:21.390 --> 01:10:23.960
So you have a lot of theoreticians

01:10:23.960 --> 01:10:27.510
talking about quantum
phenomena in different ways.

01:10:27.510 --> 01:10:29.590
And some of the anomalies in theory

01:10:29.590 --> 01:10:32.820
are anomalies in talk about quanta,

01:10:32.820 --> 01:10:37.510
not talk about not the phenomena,
not the quanta themselves.

01:10:37.510 --> 01:10:42.080
So you're presuming to
over come, to offset,

01:10:42.080 --> 01:10:46.203
to sabotage some classical
ideas of causality

01:10:47.560 --> 01:10:49.680
as energy transfer for example,

01:10:49.680 --> 01:10:53.420
just on the basis of
ideas in quantum theory,

01:10:53.420 --> 01:10:57.320
which explain experiments that
are incompletely understood.

01:10:57.320 --> 01:11:00.650
So an incomplete understanding
of quantum phenomena

01:11:00.650 --> 01:11:04.080
is producing ideas of
causality that offset

01:11:04.080 --> 01:11:06.713
or undermine ideas of causality,

01:11:07.810 --> 01:11:10.040
which seem fairly well grounded in

01:11:10.040 --> 01:11:12.080
thermodynamics or biology.

01:11:12.080 --> 01:11:14.434
- Yeah, no, I disagree with this.

01:11:14.434 --> 01:11:16.180
- (indistinct)evidence.

01:11:16.180 --> 01:11:18.810
I mean, for instance,
the first ICO switch test

01:11:18.810 --> 01:11:20.326
that was done by(indistinct),,

01:11:20.326 --> 01:11:24.510
like they developed a system
