01:11:24.510 --> 01:11:26.240
that was more effective

01:11:26.240 --> 01:11:27.900
when they built it this
way than the other.

01:11:27.900 --> 01:11:29.740
So that cries out to me as a philosopher,

01:11:29.740 --> 01:11:31.970
says there's something
