01:11:34.520 --> 01:11:38.190
but Yemima sorry, you have been
waiting patiently(chuckles).

01:11:38.190 --> 01:11:39.203
- Yeah, no, no.

01:11:40.250 --> 01:11:43.150
Well, I certainly don't want to

01:11:43.150 --> 01:11:45.510
throw away robust causal notions

01:11:45.510 --> 01:11:48.220
in the classical level on to the contrary.

01:11:48.220 --> 01:11:53.220
I think my constraints work
well in classical physics,

01:11:53.960 --> 01:11:57.410
but many of them, even
if not the causal order,

01:11:57.410 --> 01:11:59.050
as I emphasized,

01:11:59.050 --> 01:12:02.960
that I'm willing to be
open-minded about the causal order

01:12:04.470 --> 01:12:06.490
in view of these new experiments,

01:12:06.490 --> 01:12:10.050
but there are more symmetries
and conservation laws

01:12:10.050 --> 01:12:12.780
in quantum mechanics than
in classical mechanics.

01:12:12.780 --> 01:12:15.360
So I think in this sense,

01:12:15.360 --> 01:12:18.910
some of the constraints are
satisfied in quantum mechanics

01:12:18.910 --> 01:12:22.110
so I don't think quantum
mechanics is in a causal theory

01:12:22.110 --> 01:12:24.510
or theory which has no causality.

01:12:24.510 --> 01:12:27.000
Maybe, then this is what Elise

01:12:28.691 --> 01:12:31.823
the question at least opened our eyes to.

01:12:32.940 --> 01:12:35.690
Maybe there is no causal order there.

01:12:35.690 --> 01:12:38.810
But then the more important
question is reduction.

01:12:38.810 --> 01:12:40.740
I'm not a reductionist.

01:12:40.740 --> 01:12:43.370
I think in order to have reduction

01:12:43.370 --> 01:12:46.650
we have to translate the
laws of the higher level

01:12:46.650 --> 01:12:48.330
into the laws of the lower level

01:12:48.330 --> 01:12:50.420
and the concept of the higher level

01:12:50.420 --> 01:12:52.410
to the concept of the lower level.

01:12:52.410 --> 01:12:54.710
And the idea is that once we do that,

01:12:54.710 --> 01:12:56.440
everything will be explained,

01:12:56.440 --> 01:12:58.090
but it doesn't work that way

01:12:58.090 --> 01:13:01.070
because we learn that very often,

01:13:01.070 --> 01:13:03.560
a lot of the properties
of the higher level

01:13:03.560 --> 01:13:08.560
are completely insensitive
to things on the lower level.

01:13:08.990 --> 01:13:13.890
And therefore it is
preferable to use properties

01:13:13.890 --> 01:13:16.460
and concepts of the higher level

01:13:16.460 --> 01:13:20.000
to explain phenomena that
happen on the higher level.

01:13:20.000 --> 01:13:22.050
So I'm not a reductionist.

01:13:22.050 --> 01:13:26.280
And this is also related
to the problem of free will

01:13:26.280 --> 01:13:30.020
because in order to
have an explanatory law,

01:13:30.020 --> 01:13:33.080
we have to explain the explanandum

01:13:33.080 --> 01:13:37.270
that is the phenomena
that we want to explain.

01:13:37.270 --> 01:13:39.420
We have to describe it

01:13:39.420 --> 01:13:43.240
in a way that matches the
description in the law.

01:13:43.240 --> 01:13:47.420
If we want to explain
why this boat is sunk,

01:13:47.420 --> 01:13:49.940
we have to use the
weight that it can carry

01:13:49.940 --> 01:13:51.740
and the weight that was put on it

01:13:51.740 --> 01:13:56.260
and it will help us understand
why it couldn't float.

01:13:56.260 --> 01:14:01.260
But the name of the captain
and the shirt he had on,

01:14:02.330 --> 01:14:04.190
that day won't help us.

01:14:04.190 --> 01:14:06.820
So we have to have the right description.

01:14:06.820 --> 01:14:09.840
And I think that a lot of the properties

01:14:09.840 --> 01:14:11.740
that we need for mental activity

01:14:11.740 --> 01:14:13.230
are not physical properties.

01:14:13.230 --> 01:14:16.620
Physics has nothing to
say about all the people,

01:14:16.620 --> 01:14:19.720
the group of people whose
name begins with a B.

01:14:19.720 --> 01:14:21.120
It's not a natural kind.

01:14:21.120 --> 01:14:23.240
So we cannot expect that physics

01:14:23.240 --> 01:14:26.210
will have something to say
about that group of people

01:14:26.210 --> 01:14:29.310
in the way it has something
to say about electrons.

01:14:29.310 --> 01:14:30.410
And in the same sense,

01:14:30.410 --> 01:14:33.520
I don't think that
physics can say something

01:14:33.520 --> 01:14:36.713
about all the things in the
words that can be frightening.

01:14:38.700 --> 01:14:40.980
There is nothing common in physical terms

01:14:40.980 --> 01:14:43.260
to all the frightening things.

01:14:43.260 --> 01:14:46.810
So I think even in a deterministic world,

01:14:46.810 --> 01:14:49.760
there is some sense of freedom

01:14:49.760 --> 01:14:52.080
in the sense that we cannot explain

01:14:52.080 --> 01:14:56.330
and therefore we cannot
predict our actions

01:14:56.330 --> 01:14:58.740
because the description of the action

01:14:58.740 --> 01:15:01.800
doesn't match any natural kind

01:15:01.800 --> 01:15:06.650
that a law of physics can be
hooked to or hooked on to.

01:15:06.650 --> 01:15:10.460
And it's the very limited sense of freedom

01:15:10.460 --> 01:15:14.180
and I think it may connect
well with what you said,

01:15:14.180 --> 01:15:16.947
but even in this limited sense

01:15:16.947 --> 01:15:21.947
is consoling because it can even

01:15:23.750 --> 01:15:25.920
be realized in a deterministic world.

01:15:25.920 --> 01:15:28.050
And we don't know that our
world is deterministic,

01:15:28.050 --> 01:15:29.920
but even in a deterministic world,

01:15:29.920 --> 01:15:33.553
we can have that kind of non
reductionism and freedom.

01:15:34.460 --> 01:15:35.360
- [Man] Thank you.

01:15:37.470 --> 01:15:38.350
- Thank you so much.

01:15:38.350 --> 01:15:40.960
So there's a question from Jenny Wagner,

01:15:40.960 --> 01:15:44.540
